From: joethedev5 <deepsbx1@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:08:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/25] Restore the tcp_seg_sent RB tree generator

The eleven tcp_seg_sent_tree_head_RB_* entries that DWARF reports at
tcp_segment.c:45 are the functions emitted by one RB_GENERATE over
tcp_seg_cmp.  Replace the per-function stubs with that macro, matching
the reference's move of the generator out of tcp_subr.c.

Remaining explicit stubs: 226.

Authored-By: joethedev5 <joeshmo@nunya.com>
---
 bsd/netinet/tcp_segment.c | 87 +--------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 86 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bsd/netinet/tcp_segment.c b/bsd/netinet/tcp_segment.c
index 33275f742..4b52915e1 100644
--- a/bsd/netinet/tcp_segment.c
+++ b/bsd/netinet/tcp_segment.c
@@ -21,92 +21,7 @@ tcp_seg_cmp(const struct tcp_seg_sent *seg1, const struct tcp_seg_sent *seg2)
 }
 
